#: ../main.lua:1008
msgid ""
"Usage Tips\n"
"\n"
"Select:\n"
"Highlight text (or a word) in the book, then press [AI assistant] in the poped up menu.\n"
"\n"
"Long Press:\n"
"- On a Prompt Button: Add to the highlight menu.\n"
"- On a highlight menu button to remove it.\n"
"- On the Close button to go back to the book in 1 step.\n"
"\n"
"Very-Long Press (over 3 seconds):\n"
"On a single word in the book to show the highlight menu (instead of the dictionary).\n"
"\n"
"Multi-Swipe (e.g., ⮠, ⮡, ↺):\n"
"On the result dialog to close (as the Close button is far to reach).\n"
msgstr ""
"Gebruikswenke\n"
"\n"
"Kies:\n"
"Merk teks (of 'n woord) in die boek, en druk dan [AI-assistent] in die opgespringde kieslys.\n"
"\n"
"Lang Druk:\n"
"- Op 'n Vinnige Knoppie: Voeg by die merk-kieslys.\n"
"- Op 'n merk-kieslys knoppie om dit te verwyder.\n"
"- Op die Sluit-knoppie om in 1 stap terug te gaan na die boek.\n"
"\n"
"Baie Lang Druk (oor 3 sekondes):\n"
"Op 'n enkele woord in die boek om die merk-kieslys te wys (in plaas van die woordeboek).\n"
"\n"
"Multi-Vee (bv., ⮠, ⮡, ↺):\n"
"Op die resultaat-dialoog om te sluit (aangesien die Sluit-knoppie ver is om te bereik).\n"

